~ start
Danilo: [center]Which bus should I take?[/center]
Danilo: [center]I need to find the bus to Santa Claridad.[/center]
=> END

~ Bus_1
Danilo: [center]Montelargo... This isn’t the bus I’m supposed to take.[/center]
do set_bus_used("bus_1")
=> END

~ Bus_2
Danilo: [center]Nueva Esperanza... This isn’t the bus I’m supposed to take.[/center]
do set_bus_used("bus_2")
=> END

~ Bus_3
Danilo: [center]San Martino... This isn’t the bus I’m supposed to take.[/center]
do set_bus_used("bus_3")
=> END

~ Bus_4
Danilo: [center]Santa Claridad... Found it at last.[/center]
Danilo: [center]Now, I just need to buy a ticket.[/center]
do set_bus_used("bus_4")
do ObjectiveManager.complete_objective(2)
do ObjectiveManager.add_objective(3, "Buy a ticket")
=> END

