=> END

~ Bus_6
Danilo: [center]Granada Del Sur... This isn’t the bus I’m supposed to take.[/center]
do set_bus_used("bus_6")
=> END

~ Buy_ticket
Danilo: Manong, may I have a ticket to Santa Claridad, please?
Conductor: Here you go, iho.
Danilo: Thank you, manong.
do ObjectiveManager.complete_objective(3)
do ObjectiveManager.add_objective(4, "Board the bus to Santa Claridad")
=> END

~ Npc
Danilo: [center]I need to find the bus to Santa Claridad first before buying a ticket.[/center]
=> END

~ unknown_message
do ChatManager.send_chat("unknown_sender", "Unknown Number", "So, nagdecide ka pa lang bumalik?")
Unknown_sender: [wait=1.5]So, you finally decided to come back?
- Answer => Answer
- Ignore => Ignore
=> END

~ Ignore
do SaveManager.save_moral_choice("act_2_scene_3", "relief")
do ChatManager.send_chat("unknown_sender", "Player", "Tumigil ka na!")
Danilo: Leave me alone!
do Hud.phone_outro()
=> END

~ Answer
do SaveManager.save_moral_choice("act_2_scene_3", "restless")
do ChatManager.send_chat("unknown_sender", "Player", "Oo. I need answers.")
Danilo: Yeah. I need answers.
do Hud.phone_outro()
=> END
